# NOTE: android/keystore/ and android/keystore.properties ARE committed on
# purpose. GitHub Actions cannot create repository secrets for this project, and
# a stable signing key is required so that a new APK installs as an *update*
# over a previously installed one. See keystore.properties for the trade-off.
